        "content": "## 01 Social post with human approval\nA post request is checked (channel, length, media URL), then its **request_id** is claimed in the ledger: a repeat answers `200 duplicate` and does nothing, even when copies arrive at the same moment. The sender gets `202` at once; the rest runs in the background.",
